An '''embryo room''' was located in the [[Tipoca City Military Complex]], a [[Galactic Republic]] military complex located in [[Tipoca City]], the [[capital]] [[city]] of the [[planet]] [[Kamino]]. It held the embryos of the [[clone trooper]]s, and was where the [[Jedi Order]] became aware of [[Behavioral modification biochip|inhibitor chips]] which had been placed into the [[brain]]s of the [[Cloning|clones]] at birth to supposedly inhibit aggression.<ref name="Fugitive" />

